This is my rough TODO list.  Just in case you want to
contribute on these, or on the contrary if you don't
want to work on something that somebody else may do :)
If you think there is something that should be added
to that list, please e-mail me.

High priority
=============

GENERAL There are several comments in French.  They shall be translated.

GENERAL The code is VERY UGLY and needs to be cleaned up.


Medium priority
===============

GENERAL Some filenames are in french, they should be translated.

GENERAL Some parts should be modularized. Especially, ensure 
        that gfx/sound/mouse/joystick/keyboard-calls are not squattered 
        throughout the code.

DISPLAY Direct X11 support would be nice.

INPUT   A mouse interface is needed for the editor.

EDITOR  The builtin editor must be ported.

MISC    Saves of games/options/scores are only performed when quitting, this
	may not be good.  Think of the case were two heroes process access
	a global score file.

MISC	It would be nice to have games/options/scores files in text format.

INSTALL Some ./configure options should be added to specify data paths.

I18N    Use gettext.

Low priority
============

SOUND   Test with older version of MikMod.

SOUND   Try to play with DMODE_SOFT_MUSIC and GUS.

GFX	Would Hermes be faster than LibGGI's crossblit ?

EDITOR  The external editor should be ported too, it will need more work.
